constraints:
1<= A.length(), B.length() <= 10^{4}

expected time complexity: O(N) where N is max(length of A, length of B)
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def transform(self, A, B):
		if len(A) != len(B):
			return -1
		c = [0] * 256
		for i in range(len(A)):
			c[ord(A[i])] += 1
			c[ord(B[i])] -= 1
		for i in range(256):
			if c[i] != 0:
				return -1
		i = len(A) - 1
		j = len(B) - 1
		opr = 0
		while i >= 0:
			if A[i] != B[j]:
				opr += 1
			else:
				j -= 1
			i -= 1
		return opr
